IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STRINGS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 FIRST-NAME  PIC X(10) VALUE "JOHN".
01 LAST-NAME   PIC X(10) VALUE "SMITH".
01 FULL-NAME   PIC X(25).
01 PTR         PIC 99 VALUE 1.
01 CSV-LINE    PIC X(40) VALUE "a,b,c".
01 FLD-1       PIC X(10).
01 FLD-2       PIC X(10).
01 FLD-3       PIC X(10).
01 CNT         PIC 99.
01 CNT-A       PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    STRING FIRST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
           " " DELIMITED BY SIZE
           LAST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
        INTO FULL-NAME
        WITH POINTER PTR
        ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY "too long"
    END-STRING
    UNSTRING CSV-LINE DELIMITED BY "," OR ALL SPACE
        INTO FLD-1 FLD-2 FLD-3
        TALLYING IN CNT
    END-UNSTRING
    INSPECT FULL-NAME TALLYING CNT-A FOR ALL "S"
    INSPECT FULL-NAME TALLYING CNT FOR LEADING SPACES
    INSPECT FULL-NAME REPLACING ALL "J" BY "j"
    INSPECT FULL-NAME REPLACING FIRST "O" BY "0" AFTER INITIAL " "
    INSPECT FULL-NAME CONVERTING "abc" TO "ABC"
    MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE (FIRST-NAME) TO FLD-1
    MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH (FULL-NAME) TO CNT
    STOP RUN.
